  "abstract": "This submission marks a pivot to a new research paradigm. It tests the low-rank factorization hypothesis with a simple, baseline model. The architecture encodes neuron histories, aggregates them into global factors, forecasts these factors with an MLP, and decodes them with a linear loading matrix. The goal is not to achieve a new SOTA, but to validate the core assumption and establish a performance baseline for this new research direction.",
